The Peer to Peer Logistics is used for providing organizational support and is coordinated and operated solely by peers. The challenge for this strategy is to create a solid community that activate new relationships between givers and receivers. The giver can be a local trader or a private entity. For example, in the Subito.it platform, the givers describe her item and upload the image of the product which is willing to sell, the receiver will make an offer or pay whatever has been requested only when the two entities will meet. The two can define a meeting point where the sale will be concluded.